{{!
    @template local_chuspasocial/wall

    Wall template for local_chuspasocial.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-action=load-more
    * data-page

    Context variables required for this template:
    * nextpage - Optional positive integer for the next page in a zero-based feed.
      The caller must confirm that this page contains more visible posts before
      providing it. Omit or set to null when there is no next page.
      This template controls visibility and escapes the value; it does not
      validate page numbers, query the feed or load additional posts.
    * posts - List of posts of the wall. Each post is rendered with the
      local_chuspasocial/post template and has:
        * id - Post id.
        * authorname - Full name of the author.
        * authorpictureurl - URL of the author profile picture.
        * timecreated - Unix timestamp of the post.
        * content - Post content, already formatted with format_text().
        * tags - List of tags of the post (name and url).
      Empty or omitted when there are no posts.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "nextpage": 1,
        "posts": [
            {
                "id": 1,
                "authorname": "Ana Pérez",
                "authorpictureurl": "https://example.com/pix/u/f2.png",
                "timecreated": 1760000000,
                "content": "<p>Vendo mi libro de Cálculo I, casi nuevo.</p>",
                "tags": [
                    {"name": "calculo", "url": "https://example.com/tag/index.php?tag=calculo"}
                ]
            },
            {
                "id": 2,
                "authorname": "Luis Mamani",
                "authorpictureurl": "https://example.com/pix/u/f3.png",
                "timecreated": 1760003600,
                "content": "<p>Busco apuntes de Física Básica I.</p>",
                "tags": []
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="local_chuspasocial_wall" data-region="wall">
    {{#posts}}
        {{> local_chuspasocial/post}}
    {{/posts}}
    {{^posts}}
        <p class="text-muted" data-region="wall-empty">Aún no hay publicaciones</p>
    {{/posts}}
    {{#nextpage}}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-action="load-more" data-page="{{nextpage}}"
                aria-label="Cargar más">
            Cargar más
        </button>
    {{/nextpage}}
</div>
